          "screen": "Repo root, file `.env.local`",
          "action": "Make sure it has `PB_URL`, `PB_SUPERUSER_EMAIL` and `PB_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD` for the target PocketBase. `CDS_EMAIL_TRANSPORT` unset means owner emails are logged, not sent",
