          "expected": "`PASS signed in`, then a table `#  Org  Type  Status  Age  SLA  Assignee` with one row per open ticket, most urgent first (for example `1042  Rivera Bakery  Problem  Open  4h  due in 11h  —`; a paid ticket ends with `paid: design changes`), and a last line such as `3 tickets · 1 at risk · 0 missed`"
